			(property "Description" "TI ISOUSB211: galvanic USB2.0 isolator (LS/FS/HS to 480Mbps), used to isolate J2/GND_USB domain from main GND (XU316 side). Side1 (pins1-14, UD+/UD- toward J2): VBUS1+VCC1 both fed from J2 VBUS (4.25-5.5V) - internal LDOs generate V3P3V1/V1P8V1 locally, decoupled only, no external supply needed. Side2 (pins15-28, DD+/DD- toward XU316 USB_DP/DM): external-supply mode - V3P3V2/VBUS2 tied together to +3V3_XU, V1P8V2/VCC2 tied together to +1V8_XU (both from the main non-isolated cascade, since side2 lives on main GND). EQ1x/EQ2x=00 (shortest-trace default, verify against layout). CDPENZ1/2 tied high (disable CDP/charging-port advertising, pure USB2.0 data)."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
					(hide yes)
				)
			)
