				)
			)
			(property "Description" "XMOS xcore.ai USB Audio processor, 60-pin QFN. Replaces PCM2704C+AK4118: USB Audio class device -> I2S output direct to AK4490 (firmware not included, out of scope). GPIO port-to-function assignment (QSPI flash, I2S) is a firmware/software decision - the pin suffixes here (_SS/_SCLK/_IO0 etc, _BICK/_LRCK/_SDATA/_MCLK) are this schematic's chosen assignment, not a fixed hardware pinout. VDD=0.9V core (pins 4,12,19,27,34,42,49,57,61-64), VDDIOB18=1.8V (17,26), VDDIOL/R/T=3.3V (8,38,52), PLL_AVDD=1.8V analog, USB_VDD18/33=USB PHY power, VSS(65)=ground incl. exposed thermal pad."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
